            "content": "Here are the verification results for **veh_001**:\n\n| Condition | Result |\n|---|---|\n| ✅ All doors **locked** | **PASS** — All doors are confirmed locked |\n| ❌ All doors **unlocked** | **FAIL** — Doors are not unlocked (they're locked) |\n\n**The service ticket will not be created.** The two conditions are mutually exclusive — a door cannot be both locked *and* unlocked at the same time. Since the \"all doors unlocked\" check **failed**, the prerequisite of *both* conditions being true is not met.\n\n**Current vehicle state summary:**\n- All doors: 🔒 **Locked**\n- Engine: Off\n- Gear: Park (P)\n- Battery Voltage: 12.6V\n- Status: Parked\n\nIf you'd like to create a service ticket for a different reason, or if you meant to check a different set of conditions (e.g., verifying just that all doors are locked), I'm happy to help!"
